@startuml CL_NotDrawnNotice
' requirement REQ-00021-1

' The entities that carry a diagram kind the renderer does not draw from
' the source to the SVG and to stderr: the frontend classifies the tree
' and emits an IR whose `notice` names the kind, both emitters draw the
' notice through the shared markup, and the command line repeats it.
' Module subs are the unit of composition in this LLD, so the chapter
' shows the whole modules involved.

!startsub NotDrawnNotice

!includesub CL_FrontendModule.puml!FrontendModule
!includesub CL_IrModule.puml!IrModule
!includesub CL_SharedModule.puml!SharedModule
!includesub CL_EngineModule.puml!EngineModule
!includesub CL_SequenceModule.puml!SequenceModule
!includesub CL_CliModule.puml!CliModule

render.cli.main ..> render.frontend.pumlToIr : classify, IR with notice
render.cli.main ..> render.engine.renderSvg
render.engine.renderSvg ..> render.sequence.renderSequenceSvg : lifelines
render.engine.renderSvg ..> render.shared.noticeMarkup
render.sequence.renderSequenceSvg ..> render.shared.noticeMarkup
render.frontend.pumlToIr ..> render.ir.validateIr

!endsub

@enduml
